OL,3,GNEWSAHow 'largest phone smuggling
OL,4,Anetwork' was uncovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt started with a single stolen mobile
OL,7,Fphone, found inside a sealed parcel,
OL,8,Finside a warehouse near Heathrow
OL,9,Fairport.
OL,11,FIt ended in police dismantling what
OL,12,Fdetectives believe to be the UK's
OL,13,Flargest phone smuggling network.
OL,15,FThe device had been electronically
OL,16,Ftracked down to the warehouse not by
OL,17,Fofficers- but by a victim- who'd had it
OL,18,Fstolen from them just before Christmas
OL,19,Fin 2024 and alerted the DHL courier
OL,20,Fcompany.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
